{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14905","headline":"首冬寄河东昭德里书事贻郑损仓曹 · 卢纶","name":"首冬寄河东昭德里书事贻郑损仓曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清冬和暖天，老钝昼多眠。\n日爱闾巷静，每闻官吏贤。\n寒葅供家食，腐叶宿厨烟。\n且复执杯酒，无烦轻议边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}